<section class="section section-lg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head-c">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we offer</span>
      <h2>Cybersecurity education for curious learners and proactive teams.</h2>
      <p>Whether you are learning cybersecurity for the first time or searching for a way to build safer software, QueryLock teaches security in a way that is clear, practical, and built around true understanding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offerings-grid">
      <a href="/learning" class="offering-card">
        <div class="offering-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/>
            <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/>
            <path d="M8 7h8M8 11h6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Guides Everyone Can Understand</h3>
        <p class="desc">Short, practical guides that help you understand technology and cybersecurity without needing a technical background first. In about 15 minutes, you can go from hearing a term to understanding how it works, why it matters, and what security risks come with it.</p>
        <ul class="offering-features">
          <li class="offering-feature">Explore the cloud, AI, databases, containers, web applications, firewalls, and more</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Learn how the technology works and where security risks appear</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Build conversational confidence in about 15 minutes</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">No coding or cybersecurity background needed</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Read one focused guide instead of piecing together hours of content</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="offering-foot">
          <span class="offering-link">Explore the Guides <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/training" class="offering-card alt">
        <div class="offering-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H7a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M21 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Tailored Training for Lasting Security</h3>
        <p class="desc">Hands-on security training built around your team&rsquo;s real environment. We tailor workshops to your stack, architecture, experience level, and goals so security becomes part of how your team builds, reviews, and ships software.</p>
        <ul class="offering-features">
          <li class="offering-feature">Secure coding training based on your technology and specific risks</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Optional secure code review and secure development lifecycle topics</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Findings-based workshops after a pentest or code review</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">AI and LLM security training for modern product teams</li>
          <li class="offering-feature">Practical improvements your team can apply after the workshop</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="offering-foot">
          <span class="offering-link">Schedule Training <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
